profile c? th? g?i DAL tr?c ti?p.&lt;br&gt;Procurement: PurchaseOrderService; repository interfaces trong BLL; th?m Procurement.Excel.&lt;br&gt;Inventory: Putaway qua PutawayService; InboundsController g?i InboundRepository / ReceiptQueries tr?c ti?p.&lt;br&gt;Warehouse: controllers g?i DAL; Warehouse.BLL ch?a c? logic nghi?p v? v? kh?ng tham gia chu?i ph? thu?c.&lt;br&gt;(*) DAL ? BLL v? BLL ? Models ?p d?ng cho Identity, Catalog, Procurement, Inventory; kh?ng ?p d?ng Warehouse.&lt;br&gt;C?c API li?n quan s? d?ng th? vi?n d?ng chung theo danh s?ch ? ph?n tr?n; kh?ng c? Sales service hi?n t?i." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#334155;fontSize=15;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="1170" width="1440" height="245" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;b&gt;QUY ??C &amp;amp; PH?M VI&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;N?t ??t ?use?: ph? thu?c package. N?t li?n HTTP/JSON: giao ti?p l?c ch?y, kh?ng ph?i ProjectReference.&lt;br&gt;API ? BLL / Models c? th? qua tham chi?u b?c c?u t? DAL; h?nh kh?ng ch? li?t k? ProjectReference tr?c ti?p.&lt;br&gt;Middleware ???c c?u h?nh t?i Program.cs; kh?ng gi? ??nh c? c?c l?p LoggingMiddleware / ValidationMiddleware ri?ng.&lt;br&gt;WMS.Audit ph?c v? ??c audit; ghi audit hi?n n?m trong repository Procurement / Inventory.&lt;br&gt;M? h?nh t?ng qu?t to?n backend. L??c b? l?p m?u WeatherForecast / Class1 v? c?ng c? Identity.Seed." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#334155;fontSize=15;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="1455" width="1440" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e0" value="?use?" source="gw" target="sec" parent="1" edge="1" style="endArrow=open;endFill=0;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;dashed=1;"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e1" value="?use?" s